# Budget the frame
@scenario office_lesson_28
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk point]
pip: A full-size background should not be recomputed just because a character blinks.
pip: Play the lighting example in the engine repository. Compare cold rendering with repeated frames of the same pose.
@label check
pip: What makes a lighting cache safe to reuse?
> The previous image has the same filename alone. -> retry
> The source, rig and relevant dimensions still match. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: The key has to represent the inputs that can change pixels. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: The key has to represent the inputs that can change pixels.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_28]
[flag tutorial_done_28]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
